BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Balandrau\, Where the Fierce Wind Blew
DTSTART:20260518T000000Z
DTEND:20260518T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T000000Z
UID:RpixdHlAr8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 116 mins (1h56m)\n\nOn December 30\, 2000\, friends 
 climbing Mount Balandrau in the Catalan Pyrenees get caught in a sudden\, 
 savage blizzard. Visibility vanishes\, winds roar\, and survival becomes a
  desperate fight against one of the mountain’s deadliest storms. Produce
 r Guille Cascante scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ba
 landrau-where-the-fierce-wind-blew\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RADIOHEART: The Drive and Times of DJ Kevin Cole
DTSTART:20260518T030000Z
DTEND:20260518T044000Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T030000Z
UID:kvibpJeXnB
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 83 mins (1h23m)\n\nIn his 25-year tenure at KEXP\, D
 J Kevin Cole helped define not just who Seattle listens to\, but how we li
 sten\, fostering delight and curiosity with every recommendation. RADIOHEA
 RT\, a bio-doc about Cole’s remarkable life\, boasts a killer soundtrack
 \, a wealth of nostalgic archival footage\, and cameos from Seattle musica
 l legends.Directors Peter Hilgendorf and Andrew Franks\, plus Producer Reb
 ecca Staffel and Subject Kevin Cole scheduled to attend.This film is gener
 ously sponsored by David Prokopy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/radiohe
 art-the-drive-and-times-of-dj-kevin-cole\n\nEstimated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
